BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Celine Dion Tribute - Celebrating Celine
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTSTAMP:20261009T171050Z
UID:c8b2978490a24502d60b98bc402c@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating Celine with Jenene Caramielo is a premier musical 
 tribute to Celine Dion. Be amazed as Jenene effortlessly recreates Celine
 ’s iconic power ballads such as “My Heart Will Go On\,” “It's All 
 Coming Back to Me Now\,” “Because You Loved Me” and many more. Befor
 e traveling the globe as a sought-after headliner on luxury cruise lines R
 egent\, Oceania and Crystal\, or selling out top cabaret rooms such as Fei
 nstein’s 54 Below in New York City and the Royal Room in Palm Beach\, Je
 nene Caramielo honed her craft with a wide variety of experiences and educ
 ation. From her early work in regional theater musicals such as The Music 
 Man and Fiddler on the Roof\, to opera workshops including Aida\, to lead 
 vocalist in pop music-packed theme park productions\, Jenene’s lifelong 
 training and work in voice\, dance\, piano\, and acting &amp\; improvisati
 on has delighted audiences the world over. Jenene studied classical voice 
 at the Civic Light Opera in Pittsburgh\, as well as Carnegie Mellon Univer
 sity\, and graduated with a Bachelor of Fine Arts in Musical Theater from 
 Shenandoah Conservatory. A true crossover entertainer\, she is as adept at
  belting a Celine Dion or Whitney Houston song as she is performing an ari
 a or captivating audiences with Broadway show tunes. Jenene has shared a s
 tage with Chicago\, opened for the Beach Boys\, kicked off Major League Ba
 seball games with our national anthem\, sung for celebrities and world lea
 ders\, and performed at some of the most exclusive private country clubs i
 n the United States. She says\, though\, that her greatest honor to date w
 as performing at the Governor’s Ball at The White House backed by the Un
 ited States Marine Band\, Navy Sea Chanters\, and Air Force Singing Sergea
 nts. Tickets: $31\, $36\, $41 The Stadium Theatre is not responsible for f
 ulfillment or refund for any purchases made from a third party website.\n
 \nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/celine-dion-tribute-celeb
 rating-celine/111602/
LOCATION:Stadium Theatre\, 28 Monument Square\, Woonsocket\, 02895 Time: 8
 :00 PM to 10:00 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/celine-dion-tribute-celebrating
 -celine/111602/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fall Fest at The Loom Hotel
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTSTAMP:20261009T171050Z
UID:47f0982d49df287bc119c3859f07@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate fall at The Loom with seasonal drinks\, local vendor
 s\, festive activities\, and riverside views. Celebrate fall along the riv
 er at Fall Fest at The Loom Hotel! Join us on the Riverview Deck for an af
 ternoon of seasonal drinks\, local makers\, fall-inspired activities\, and
  some of our favorite Rhode Island businesses. Shop\, sip\, snack\, and di
 scover a curated lineup of local businesses\, including: Koncocted Bloom B
 ar Experience - Grab beautiful handcrafted bouquets or create your own wit
 h local Rhode Island-grown farm-fresh flowers &amp\; thrifted vases. Bijou
 x Brie Permanent Jewelry &#8211\; Find your new favorite piece with custom
 -fit permanent jewelry. Herbs and Mylk Luxury Botanical Skincare &#8211\; 
 Shop handcrafted botanical skincare and self-care favorites. Holiday by Na
 y &#8211\; Enjoy homemade baked goods by Danasia. Hammer and Stain by Craf
 ty Girls DIY &#8211\; A mobile craft business. Sammallas - Vintage and Han
 dmade Jewelry Come sip\, shop\, snack\, and support local while enjoying a
 n October afternoon by the river at The Loom. 🍂\n\nSource: https://www.
 visitrhodeisland.com/event/fall-fest-at-the-loom-hotel/111938/
LOCATION:The Loom Hotel Tapestry Collection by Hilton - Warwick\, 400 Knig
 ht Street\, Warwick\, RI 02886
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/fall-fest-at-the-loom-hotel/111
 938/
END:VEVENT
